cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "bmlab"
abstract: >-
  Library for reading, evaluating and exporting Brillouin microscopy data; this version adds support for the
  overview engine of BrillouinAcquisition, the drift correction applied while measuring and the export of the
  overview images.
authors:
